SUMMARY:Hamilton Drink Specials
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate the historic musical only at DPAC now through June 14th with some specials you’re sure to love. Don’t throw away your shot – take it like a champ with a 20 oz pour during our Hamilton Drink Specials Event! Or sip on our Satisfied Sangria to tempt your inner Maria Reynolds. Either way they’ll leave you humming a tune.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/hamilton-drink-specials/
LOCATION:The Glass Jug Downtown\, 545 Foster Street\, Suite 10\, Durham\, 27701
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/image-77.jpg
