SUMMARY:Fun With Frit- Fused Glass Class- Minimum 2 Students Required
DESCRIPTION:Taught by glass artist Robyn Cook.\nIn this class\, students will create a 5 x 7 creation mostly using frit glass. Students MUST bring a 5 x 7-inch photo or drawing to be used as a template for what they would like to create.\nSkills for making frit will be taught. Previous experience encouraged but not necessary.\nGlass pieces will be fired after class and will be ready for pick up approximately 1-2 weeks after class. You will be contacted to arrange pickup
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/fun-with-frit-fused-glass-class-minimum-2-students-required/
