DESCRIPTION:Trivia Night with “Just Dave”! General Trivia every 1st & 3rd Monday of the month at Ment Beverage Co./Honeygirl Meadery! Free to play and prizes awarded for 1st place\, 2nd place & 3rd place teams! Come early to reserve space for your team!
