SUMMARY:Boogie Down Broadway: A Singalong Dance Party
DESCRIPTION:Ages 21+\nGet ready to bust a move and belt out your favorite tunes at Boogie Down Broadway – A Singalong Dance Party! Boogie Down Broadway: A Singalong Dance Party!\nIt’s not a show — it’s a party! Get ready for the ultimate Broadway-inspired singalong dance party\, where you are the star.\nFor one unforgettable night\, the Motorco Music Hall in Durham transforms into a high-energy celebration of the greatest musicals ever made and everyone’s invited to sing\, dance\, and party along. \nWhat to Expect:\n✅ All-Killer Showtunes – From Wicked and Les Mis to Hamilton and more\, you’ll hear all your Broadway favourites played loud and proud.\n✅ Featuring a live DJ and singing host – non-stop entertainment from curtains up to lights down.\n✅ Giant On-Screen Lyrics – Don’t worry about knowing the words — just follow along and belt it out.\n✅ It’s all about you! – This isn’t a sit-down show. It’s a full-on singalong dance party… because the crowd IS the cast.\n✅ Dance-Offs & Lip-Sync Battles – Step into the spotlight (if you dare!) or cheer on your fellow Broadway fans.\n✅ Glow-Up Giveaway– Stand out from the crowd with our glow-up giveaways from the stage. \n💥Important Note:💥\nThis is not a live theatre performance. It’s an incredible party featuring live DJs\, singers\, dancers and crowd interaction\, where YOU are the star of the show.\nExpect back-to-back showtunes\, epic singalongs\, and full dancefloor vibes.\nDoors open at 6pm.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/boogie-down-broadway-a-singalong-dance-party/
LOCATION:723 Rigsbee Avenue Durham North Carolina\, 723 Rigsbee Avenue\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults Only,DJ,Mixers and Parties,Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/BDB_DancePartyText_1x1.jpg
